<title>USA: First Banks Inc Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>First Banks Inc Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary	    $277.10		  $126.93</p>
<p> Shr diluted	     267.81		   125.52</p>
<p> Net			  7,836		    4,437</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Only preferred shares of co are publicly traded.</p>
<p>Total assets at March 31, 1997, were $3.74 billion versus $3.79 billion at March 31, 1996.</p>
